  "contract": [
    "At half health each High Priest drains the Loa Avatar in its temple to death, and its second kit starts the",
    "moment the avatar dies (CoA log of 2026-08-02: ~1% damage taken for 3-4 seconds). Arlokk (14515) gains the",
    "Gift of the Blood God (2118324) and the panther form (Aspect of Bethekk 2118323) together, when the Avatar of",
    "Bethekk (666988, spawn 9999801) dies, not while she still drains it. The hero joins phase 1 at her temple, so",
    "Arlokk, summoned there, finds the instance's own avatar."
